    "detailed_description": "<h1>Official Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/7dd6c93aff9c46f47971070b6474bade.poster.avif?t=1754691653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/7dd6c93aff9c46f47971070b6474bade.webm?t=1754691653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/7dd6c93aff9c46f47971070b6474bade.mp4?t=1754691653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/d953d606594eb8cb8c3f8403c897da72.avif?t=1754691653\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Enrich your life with real-life knowledge of plants, recipes, herbalism and more!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of nature to rebuild your home in Out and About, a cozy foraging adventure! A storm has blown through the town of Portobello. To help this little community get back on its feet, you\u2019ll need to learn all about the wild surrounding landscape.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn to identify 100+ real life plants and fungi</strong> - knowledge that carries over into real life! Forage for food, cook supplies, and form deep friendships with the town's residents, who are slowly coming together as a community striving for sustainability.<br>   <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/f3ee26a9234463e7c5428b9c48eb3f51.poster.avif?t=1754691653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/f3ee26a9234463e7c5428b9c48eb3f51.webm?t=1754691653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/f3ee26a9234463e7c5428b9c48eb3f51.mp4?t=1754691653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cook delicious recipes and brew herbal remedies</strong> to help the townsfolk. All 150+ recipes in the game are real, and we'll give you step-by-step instructions on how to make them at home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/9b753ac864090dfb7f76344a1680652b.poster.avif?t=1754691653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/9b753ac864090dfb7f76344a1680652b.webm?t=1754691653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/9b753ac864090dfb7f76344a1680652b.mp4?t=1754691653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore an open natural world, </strong>from dense forests and wide grasslands to beautiful coastal beaches and wetlands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/63bde77751c9e9aff31799fad4683f32.poster.avif?t=1754691653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/63bde77751c9e9aff31799fad4683f32.webm?t=1754691653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/63bde77751c9e9aff31799fad4683f32.mp4?t=1754691653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your character</strong> and discover different hairstyles and outfits.\u00a0<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/6f1d3afd864b084745e2943015b1c580.poster.avif?t=1754691653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/6f1d3afd864b084745e2943015b1c580.webm?t=1754691653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/6f1d3afd864b084745e2943015b1c580.mp4?t=1754691653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make friends with the charming characters around the town and become part of the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/ef1a58ea95f3e8a2832e4a9ddc271157.poster.avif?t=1754691653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/ef1a58ea95f3e8a2832e4a9ddc271157.webm?t=1754691653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/ef1a58ea95f3e8a2832e4a9ddc271157.mp4?t=1754691653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 Wishlist now! \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>",
